WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:02.734
-Welcome back, everybody.
I'm Padma Lakshmi.

00:00:02.734 --> 00:00:04.367
And we are about --
Thank you!

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:05.400
[ Applause ]

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.267
We are about to play
a fun new game

00:00:07.267 --> 00:00:08.601
called Cake Flip.

00:00:08.601 --> 00:00:10.434
-♪ Caaake flip ♪

00:00:10.434 --> 00:00:13.634
♪ Ca-a-ake fli-ip, yeah ♪

00:00:13.634 --> 00:00:14.901
-Here's how it works.

00:00:14.901 --> 00:00:16.934
We have two teams with
James, Kirk, and Jimmy

00:00:16.934 --> 00:00:20.234
taking on Tariq, Mark,
and Quest.

00:00:20.234 --> 00:00:21.300
-Alright, alright.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.033
-Each player will have
30 seconds

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:25.968
to flip a cake, catch it,
and then decorate it.

00:00:25.968 --> 00:00:29.067
When you hear the ding,
your time is up, gentlemen.

00:00:29.067 --> 00:00:31.501
We'll do three rounds,
and at the end,

00:00:31.501 --> 00:00:33.467
the audience will vote
for their favorite.

00:00:33.467 --> 00:00:35.000
It's time for Round 1.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.367
Tariq and James,
you're up first.

00:00:37.367 --> 00:00:39.000
Best of luck to both of you.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.133
When I say go,
you have 30 seconds

00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:44.200
to flip your cakes

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:47.133
and then decorate the edges
and the sides.

00:00:47.133 --> 00:00:48.701
Are you ready?
-No!

00:00:48.701 --> 00:00:51.167
-Do you have it?
-James, come on, bud!

00:00:51.167 --> 00:00:53.634
-Ready, set, go!

00:00:53.634 --> 00:00:54.868
[ Whistle blows ]

00:00:54.868 --> 00:00:56.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:56.834 --> 00:00:58.934
-Oh, my gosh!

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:00.234
-That is so good!

00:01:00.234 --> 00:01:02.501
-Make it look nice.

00:01:02.501 --> 00:01:04.701
-There you go, there you go.

00:01:04.701 --> 00:01:07.167
-Yes, keep going. Keep going!

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:10.534
Oh, those roses are beautiful.

00:01:10.534 --> 00:01:13.734
[ Applause ]

00:01:13.734 --> 00:01:16.667
You have 8 seconds left.

00:01:16.667 --> 00:01:18.033
-Some of these aren't working.

00:01:18.033 --> 00:01:20.067
-7, 6, 5...

00:01:20.067 --> 00:01:23.934
4, 3, 2, 1...

00:01:23.934 --> 00:01:25.467
[ Whistle blows ]

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:26.767
[ Bell dings ]

00:01:26.767 --> 00:01:28.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.367
-Alright. Well done.

00:01:30.367 --> 00:01:32.267
-I feel like we're in
the advantage right now.

00:01:32.267 --> 00:01:33.601
Tariq kind of went
a little easy.

00:01:33.601 --> 00:01:35.601
-Don't jinx it.
-Did I though?

00:01:35.601 --> 00:01:37.501
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:37.501 --> 00:01:39.033
-No, this is good.
-This is looking good.

00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:41.200
-Alright, are we ready
for Round 2?

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.367
-Yes.
-Alright.

00:01:42.367 --> 00:01:44.334
-Kirk, you got this, bud.

00:01:44.334 --> 00:01:46.434
-Oh, God.
-Okay, Kirk and Mark.

00:01:46.434 --> 00:01:47.767
When I say "go,"

00:01:47.767 --> 00:01:50.601
or when I -- pbbt, you know.

00:01:50.601 --> 00:01:52.834
-Mark doesn't even know
how to --

00:01:52.834 --> 00:01:55.567
-You have 30 seconds to
flip your cakes

00:01:55.567 --> 00:01:57.868
and then decorate the top.

00:01:57.868 --> 00:01:58.968
Got it?
-Got it.

00:01:58.968 --> 00:02:00.067
-Alright, okay.

00:02:00.067 --> 00:02:01.934
Ready, set, go!

00:02:01.934 --> 00:02:03.167
[ Whistle blows ]

00:02:03.167 --> 00:02:05.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:05.434 --> 00:02:07.434
-Decorate the cake!

00:02:07.434 --> 00:02:09.801
-No, that one's broken! Sorry.

00:02:09.801 --> 00:02:11.200
Use this! Use this stuff.

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:13.133
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:15.033
-Momofu-who?

00:02:15.033 --> 00:02:16.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.834 --> 00:02:18.234
-I'm making a hot dog.

00:02:18.234 --> 00:02:21.334
-What?

00:02:21.334 --> 00:02:23.367
[ Applause ]

00:02:23.367 --> 00:02:25.634
-Soft hands, soft hands.

00:02:25.634 --> 00:02:29.234
-7, 6, 5, 4...

00:02:29.234 --> 00:02:31.367
3, 2, 1...

00:02:31.367 --> 00:02:32.400
[ Whistle blows ]

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:33.868
[ Bell dings ]

00:02:33.868 --> 00:02:35.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:35.667 --> 00:02:37.567
What is that? What is that?

00:02:37.567 --> 00:02:39.033
-I...
-Is that a hot dog?

00:02:39.033 --> 00:02:40.200
-It may be a hot dog.

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:42.334
It's an electric hot dog.
-Okay.

00:02:42.334 --> 00:02:44.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.234 --> 00:02:45.367
If that's what you...

00:02:45.367 --> 00:02:47.000
-Alright, ladies and gentlemen.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.200
-We're already at
a disadvantage.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:50.834
-We're ready for our third.

00:02:50.834 --> 00:02:52.634
-How do I...

00:02:52.634 --> 00:02:54.000
How do I...

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.300
-You guys have talked about
hot dogs before!

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:57.567
-The heck is going...

00:02:57.567 --> 00:03:00.100
Certain adult stores
sell these cakes

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:01.300
in New York City.

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:03.701
-This is a family show.
-It's a family show.

00:03:03.701 --> 00:03:06.300
-Alright, we are ready for
our third and final --

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:08.033
-Wait. Quest.

00:03:08.033 --> 00:03:10.567
I think we gotta double flip it.

00:03:10.567 --> 00:03:12.033
[ Crowd exclaims ]

00:03:12.033 --> 00:03:13.934
-Say what?
-He talkin' about a --

00:03:13.934 --> 00:03:16.267
-I'm talking about
a Greg Louganis.

00:03:16.267 --> 00:03:19.100
-Remember, you have to
decorate your cakes.

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:21.367
Final round,
and Jimmy and Questlove,

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:22.501
you're up.
-How high can you flip?

00:03:22.501 --> 00:03:25.033
Bonus points for how high.
-Grab your cakes.

00:03:25.033 --> 00:03:27.067
-I have to double flip?
-Wait, wait, wait.

00:03:27.067 --> 00:03:28.300
Not only do you have to flip it,

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:31.300
you have to write a message
to me.

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:33.334
And don't phone it in with
an XO, either.

00:03:33.334 --> 00:03:35.534
Just saying. I'm just saying.

00:03:35.534 --> 00:03:37.334
Alright? Ready?

00:03:37.334 --> 00:03:39.167
-An XO? Better than what --
-Go!

00:03:39.167 --> 00:03:40.834
[ Whistle blows ]

00:03:40.834 --> 00:03:43.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:43.334 --> 00:03:44.367
-Ahhh!

00:03:44.367 --> 00:03:46.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:47.634
Look at it!

00:03:47.634 --> 00:03:53.000
-Keep going!
-Do it!

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.834
♪♪

00:03:55.834 --> 00:03:58.267
-Ahh!

00:03:58.267 --> 00:03:59.834
[ Laughter ]

00:03:59.834 --> 00:04:03.067
-There you go, there you go!
There you go!

00:04:03.067 --> 00:04:06.300
-7, 6, 5, 4....

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:09.267
3, 2, 1...

00:04:09.267 --> 00:04:10.834
[ Whistle blows ]

00:04:10.834 --> 00:04:11.934
-There you go!

00:04:11.934 --> 00:04:13.467
There you go!

00:04:13.467 --> 00:04:17.067
-Alright, now it's time to see
which one came out the best.

00:04:17.067 --> 00:04:18.334
-Look at, look at, look it.

00:04:18.334 --> 00:04:20.901
Look at what he did.

00:04:20.901 --> 00:04:22.000
What the hell is that?

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.100
[ Laughter ]

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:29.033
[ Applause ]

00:04:29.033 --> 00:04:33.934
-What is that?
-The metal tip is still in here.

00:04:33.934 --> 00:04:35.901
That's a little bonus.
-Okay.

00:04:35.901 --> 00:04:38.067
Okay, audience,
by round of applause,

00:04:38.067 --> 00:04:40.267
do you like Team Jimmy's cake?

00:04:40.267 --> 00:04:44.267
[ Applause ]

00:04:44.267 --> 00:04:46.767
Or Team Questlove's cake?

00:04:46.767 --> 00:04:50.033
[ Louder applause ]

00:04:50.033 --> 00:04:51.634
Alright.

00:04:51.634 --> 00:04:53.534
I think we have a winner.

00:04:53.534 --> 00:04:55.334
It is Team Questlove!

00:04:55.334 --> 00:04:57.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:59.567
-Ahh!

00:04:59.567 --> 00:05:02.033
[ Laughter ]

00:05:02.033 --> 00:05:05.667
[ Indistinct shouting ]

00:05:05.667 --> 00:05:07.200
-Get back! Back!
-No!

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:10.467
[ Indistinct shouting ]

00:05:10.467 --> 00:05:15.601
♪♪

00:05:15.601 --> 00:05:17.033
-A heavy weapon.

00:05:17.033 --> 00:05:22.467
♪♪

00:05:22.467 --> 00:05:24.434
-That's all the time we have
for Cake Flip.

00:05:24.434 --> 00:05:26.133
My thanks to The Roots
for playing,

00:05:26.133 --> 00:05:27.267
Padma for hosting.

00:05:27.267 --> 00:05:30.100
[ Laughter ]

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:32.834
We'll be right back.

00:05:32.834 --> 00:05:35.567
We'll be right back,
9:00 PM on Bravo.

00:05:35.567 --> 00:05:37.467
We'll be right back.
Come on back.

